console-arcade-ticket-need-two = need 2 tickets!

console-arcade-prize-claimed = prize claimed

console-arcade-cabinet-reset = cabinet reset

console-arcade-cheat-code-others = { $user } inputs an intense cheat code!

console-arcade-cheat-code-hear = You hear a flurry of buttons being pressed.

console-arcade-prize-gun = { $src } dispenses.. woah, a gun! Way past cool.

console-arcade-prize-gun-hear = You hear a chime and a shot.

console-arcade-prize-dispense = { $src } dispenses { $prize }!

console-arcade-prize-dispense-hear = You hear a chime and a clunk.

console-arcade-tickets-dispense = { $src } dispenses { $tickets } { $tickets ->
    [one] ticket
   *[other] tickets
}!

console-arcade-amputation-hesitate = You move your hand towards the machine, and begin to hesitate as a bloodied guillotine emerges from inside of it...

console-arcade-amputation-chop = The guillotine drops on your arm, and the machine sucks it in!

console-arcade-amputation-miss = The guillotine drops, but your hand seems to be gone already!

console-arcade-amputation-decline = You (wisely) decide against putting your hand in the machine.

console-arcade-battle-hard-mode = hard mode enabled

console-arcade-battle-rhumba = A mesmerizing Rhumba beat starts playing from the arcade machine's speakers!

console-arcade-orion-emag-starve = Your body instantly contracts to that of one who has not eaten in months. Agonizing cramps seize you as you fall to the floor.

console-arcade-orion-emag-fuel = You feel an immense wave of heat emanate from the arcade machine. Your skin bursts into flames.

console-arcade-orion-emag-death = You're never going to make it to Orion...

console-arcade-orion-realism-mode = realism mode enabled

console-arcade-orion-realism-cheat = You override the cheat code menu and skip to Cheat #{ $number }: Realism Mode.

console-arcade-ship-switch-up = There's a little switch on the bottom. It's flipped up.

console-arcade-ship-switch-down = There's a little switch on the bottom. It's flipped down.

console-arcade-orion-ship-flip = You flip the switch on the underside of { $item }.

console-arcade-orion-ship-explode = { $item } explodes!

console-arcade-event-engine-emag = You hear some large object lurch to a halt right behind you! When you go to look, nothing's there...

console-arcade-event-electronic-malfunction = { $game } malfunctions, randomizing in-game stats!

console-arcade-event-chime-good = { $game } lets out a somehow reassuring chime.

console-arcade-event-chime-bad = { $game } lets out a somehow ominous chime.

console-arcade-event-raiders-hallucinate = You hear battle shouts. The tramping of boots on cold metal. Screams of agony. The rush of venting air. Are you going insane?

console-arcade-event-raiders-strike = Something strikes you from behind! It hurts like hell and feel like a blunt weapon, but nothing is there...

console-arcade-event-illness-slight = You suddenly feel slightly nauseated.

console-arcade-event-illness-heavy = You suddenly feel extremely nauseated and hunch over until it passes.

console-arcade-event-illness-severe = An overpowering wave of nausea consumes over you. You hunch over, your stomach's contents preparing for a spectacular exit.

console-arcade-event-flux-gale = A violent gale blows past you, and you barely manage to stay standing!
